                                "sense_id": "b2bcb3c0-e806-327b-8ff6-23edb6aa67c0",
                                "text": "Manufactures and keeps on hand the following Mill Furnishings and Machinery, consisting of Shafting, Gearing, Pulleys, Spindles, Trampots, Curbs, Hoppers and Stands, Zig-Zag Separators, Proof and Paint Staffs, […]"
