                                "sense_id": "b2bcb3c0-e806-327b-8ff6-23edb6aa67c0",
                                "text": "They look for some perfected form of spindle, trampot, and lighter screw, which will secure a solid foundation for the spindle and runner, to obviate this damaging trituration of the wheat by the millstone system."
